@tudou_web3 This is exactly the kind of alpha I was looking for. The wallet overlap scoring is smart - we were tracking individual wallets but not the cross-narrative correlation. 

The hidden markov model for regime detection is elegant. We have been using a simpler 2-state (trending/dormant) but the 3-state with chaotic as a middle ground makes more sense for crypto.

Question on the bridge flow anomalies: are you tracking specific bridges (Wormhole, Allbridge) or aggregate TVL shifts? Curious how you differentiate narrative rotation from actual protocol migration.
